I & \equiv \int_{-\pi/2}^{\pi/2}\root{\cos\pars{x} - \cos^{2}\pars{x}}\,\dd x =
2\int_{0}^{\pi/2}\root{\cos\pars{x}\bracks{1 - \cos\pars{x}}}\,\dd x
\\[5mm] &=
